      "message": "I haven\u0027t been able to find which register this should go into. Do you have that? I\u0027ve been using this spec sheet: https://ae-bst.resource.bosch.com/media/_tech/media/datasheets/BST-BMI160-DS000.pdf. Also, I\u0027m not 100% sure about that yet. From what I gather most chips don\u0027t have a way to store the temperature alongside the calibration offset. So it seems like this chip might be unique in that manner.",
